The fleet is on srcversion `DF0E1ABC1CEA16331E2DF6C` — that's 0.11.440. The tree is 0.11.451. **Eleven versions of landed, undeployed, unverified change.**

That's the honest answer to your question. Sessions 112–134 have been landing code and consulting GPT without putting any of it on the rig, and under RULE 6 nothing can close without a test that exercises the cause. The bottleneck isn't design — it's that nothing has been verified in ~20 sessions. I'm going to stop adding design and go verify.
